{"version":1,"content":"<p>歐洲議會電信改革首席談判代表表示，歐盟必須保護本土電信行業免受外國競爭對手的威脅。一名歐盟高級議員表示，歐盟必須確保正在推進的電信規則改革，不會讓埃隆·馬斯克（Elon Musk）旗下的SpaceX更容易控制歐洲移動通信和寬帶電信市場。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583248.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.098431+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:44:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"f2e272a12c84a72c2174e9ce87d3c034c2757f7f7dfc839a2bcfd2fc3819bcac","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}